title, their employer's named product or internal system, or their personal circumstances. For nextSteps, keep each step's leading 'Name:' owner prefix exactly as given (it is replaced with an anonymous label before posting), but remove every name and affiliation from the task text after the prefix. \" : \"\") + \"Here is the summary to filter:\\n\" + JSON.stringify({ recap: $json.recap, nextSteps: $json.nextSteps }) } ] }) }}",
